TI  - AeroHydro Culture: An Integrated Approach to Improve Crop Yield and Ecological Restoration Through Root–Microbe Symbiosis in Tropical Peatlands
PY  - 2025
T2  - Land
VL  - 14
IS  - 9
C7  - 1823
