TI  - Assessing the Effect of Field Disturbances On Biomass Estimation in Grasslands Using UAV-Derived Canopy Height Models
PY  - 2025
T2  - PFG - Journal of Photogrammetry, Remote Sensing and Geoinformation Science
VL  - 93
IS  - 1
SP  - 37
EP  - 49
