TI  - UAV forestry land-cover image segmentation method based on attention mechanism and improved DeepLabV3+
ST  - 基于注意力机制和改进 DeepLabV3+的无人机林区图像地物分割方法
PY  - 2024
T2  - Journal of Nanjing Forestry University (Natural Sciences Edition)
VL  - 48
