TI  - Identification of rodent hole patches in desert grasslands using UAV imagery and OBIA-CFS algorithms
ST  - 基于无人机影像与 OBIA-CFS 算法的荒漠草原鼠洞斑块识别
PY  - 2024
T2  - Pratacultural Science
VL  - 41
IS  - 10
