TI  - Estimating Leymus chinensis Loss Caused by Oedaleus decorus asiaticus Using an Unmanned Aerial Vehicle (UAV)
PY  - 2023
T2  - Remote Sensing
VL  - 15
IS  - 17
C7  - 4352
