TI  - Estimation of fractional woody and herbaceous vegetation cover in Temperate Sparse Forest Grassland using fusion of UAV and Satellite imagery
ST  - 融合无人机和卫星影像的温带疏林草原木本和草本植物覆盖度遥感估算
PY  - 2023
