TI  - Estimating dry biomass and plant nitrogen concentration in pre-Alpine grasslands with low-cost UAS-borne multispectral data-a comparison of sensors, algorithms, and predictor sets
PY  - 2022
T2  - Biogeosciences
VL  - 19
IS  - 10
SP  - 2699
EP  - 2727
