TI  - Using UAVs Remote Sensing for Population and Distribution of Grazing Livestock in the Source Region of the Yellow River
ST  - 黄河源区放牧家畜数量及空间分布无人机遥感调查
PY  - 2021
T2  - Journal of Geo-Information Science
VL  - 23
