TI  - Mapping of kobresia pygmaea community based on umanned aerial vehicle technology and gaofen remote sensing data in alpine meadow grassland: A case study in eastern of Qinghai–Tibetan Plateau
PY  - 2021
T2  - Remote Sensing
VL  - 13
