TI  - Investigating the Potential of a Newly Developed UAV-based VNIR/SWIR Imaging System for Forage Mass Monitoring
PY  - 2020
T2  - PFG - Journal of Photogrammetry, Remote Sensing and Geoinformation Science
VL  - 88
IS  - 6
SP  - 493
EP  - 507
