TI  - Diagnostic Feed Values of Natural Grasslands Based on Multispectral Images Acquired by Small Unmanned Aerial Vehicle
PY  - 2019
T2  - Rangeland Ecology and Management
VL  - 72
IS  - 6
SP  - 916
EP  - 922
