TI  - Modeling of alpine grassland cover based on unmanned aerial vehicle technology and multi-factor methods: A case study in the east of Tibetan Plateau, China
PY  - 2018
T2  - Remote Sensing
VL  - 10
IS  - 2
C7  - 320
