TI  - Application of UAV-SfM photogrammetry and aerial lidar to a disastrous flood: Repeated topographic measurement of a newly formed crevasse splay of the Kinu River, central Japan
PY  - 2017
T2  - Natural Hazards and Earth System Sciences
VL  - 17
IS  - 9
SP  - 1505
